    [*] --> Unissued
    Unissued --> Issued: ContactRegistrationOtpIssuer under Source owner and Ticket root locks
    Issued --> Issued: ContactRegistrationOtpResendIssuer replaces generation without extending deadlines or resetting budgets
    Issued --> Verified: ContactRegistrationOtpVerificationCommitter consumes OTP and stores proof atomically
