    note right of Issued
        APP/COM email/telephone Source-owned credential_registration_otp_context.
        Original Contact ceremony UUID, Base browser digest, root, owner,
        candidate, destination and generation are immutable issuance bindings.
        Proof deadline is min(verification plus 60 seconds, original Ticket expiry).
        Delivery rechecks original Source and Ticket bindings under locks.
        All four settings HTTP callers retain proof across Source failure.
        APP email HTTP resend retains the original flow and refuses verified proof.
        First-email bootstrap uses its explicit original parent, Session and admission binding.
        Source commits before bootstrap and Contact receipts; no freshness is granted.
        Bootstrap HTTP receipt-fault recovery and cancellation remain incomplete.
        Finalization preserves this proof; receipt reconciliation requires
        the original effective binding and Source audit operation.
        No stored status is inferred from this derived challenge axis.
